# General Rules

- Every physical material has one UUID.
- Every transformation generates new material records when physical identity changes.
- Materials are never physically deleted.
- Traceability is maintained through Material Relationships.
- Cost is accumulated through transformations.
- Measurements are immutable.
- Waste is always classified.
- Recovery remains traceable.
- Every material movement generates an event.
